        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprise RPG-225, Twisted Rope Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/4 Inch Twist Ring Pull is a great way to add a stunning finishing touch to your home. It is easy to install with the included hardware. The Twisted Rope Ring Pull is for use on any light-weight door including dresser drawers, accordion closets, and cabinets. It is available in polished brass, polished chrome, polished nickel, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Made from brass, this RPG-225 ring pull is sure to stand the test of time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/twist-cabinet-pull-field-enterprise-gcp\"><b>Matching Twist Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Twist Cabinet Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes all mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting rosettes.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout Diameter: 1-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
